					<h3 class="project-title text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold" id="p-veritas-title">Veritas <span class="project-subtitle text-base font-medium text-slate-400">— Multi-Agent Research & Verification System</span></h3>
					<p class="project-desc text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
						An AI-driven multi-agent research system built around a database-backed pipeline:
						task decomposition, source-prioritized evidence gathering, claim verification with explicit
						verification states, contradiction analysis, and citation-backed synthesis. Engineering
						highlights include a 10-step input-validation gate with prompt-injection detection,
						language detection and composite risk scoring; a trained claim classifier
						(TF-IDF + logistic regression with a rule-based engine) that decides claim type and
						researchability before work enters the pipeline; and SQLite-tracked provenance —
						source URL, domain and type — across tasks, sessions, verifications and contradictions.
					</p>
