					<h3 class="project-title text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold" id="p-liveliness-title">Liveliness Detection & Face Verification System</h3>
					<p class="project-desc text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
						A computer-vision system for face verification and spoof prevention. Facial landmarks
						(MediaPipe) drive a remote-photoplethysmography check that extracts pulse signals from
						forehead and cheek regions using the CHROM algorithm, rejecting static prints and
						unstable footage through signal-strength and SNR thresholds. Image and video paths
						combine error-level analysis, LBP/geometry forensics and a CNN classifier over
						OpenCV-detected faces, with per-path results fused into a single verdict behind a
						FastAPI service and a Streamlit forensic dashboard.
					</p>
